**Why the last submission failed to deploy**

The deploy failed with `UNKNOWN_EXCEPTION` because of how I wrote the **trigger** file. A Salesforce trigger cannot contain multiple `on Case(...)` style event declarations in a single trigger — but more subtly, the real problem was that I declared **the same event more than once and referenced a class that, while valid, is packaged**. The safe, canonical TAF pattern is a single trigger declaration listing all events, with one handler instantiation per event block. I have rewritten the trigger accordingly.

